        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>6 Foot ADA Compliant Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith 6 foot center to centers, this square mitered pull is definitely big. It is made out of stainless steel with a satin (brushed) finish. The 72 Inch Stainless Steel Square Pull can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted (must order two pulls) so choose the function that best suites your application. This 6 Foot ADA Compliant Pull is available with mounting kits for use on wood, metal, fiberglass, or glass doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/24-inch-stainless-steel-square-pull\"><b>24\" Stainless Mitered Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/36-inch-stainless-steel-square-pull\"><b>36\" Stainless Mitered Pull</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/48-inch-stainless-steel-square-pull\"><b>48\" Stainless Mitered Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the 72\" Satin Stainless Steel Square Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"></a>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 72\" (1828.8 mm) C/C</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 73-1/4\" (1861 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2-3/8\" (60.3 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-5/8\" (92 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\" (32 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li> \r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><b>***THIS ITEM IS DISCONTINUED, LIMITED QUANTITIES AVAILABLE***</b></p>",
            "seo": {
